\caption(Actual held-out scene pixels with green ground-truth boxes and red component-based detection boxes. A red box is a retained prediction, not a correctness claim; many can overlap because NMS separates classes.)
\alttext(Actual held-out scene pixels with green ground-truth boxes and red component-based detection boxes. A red box is a retained prediction, not a correctness claim; many can overlap because NMS separates classes.)

